# ==================================================================================================
# CMDI: OS command injection. Keys on a shell separator (; | && $( `) directly followed by a common
# command and something that looks like an argument, so "dogs; cat people" and markdown tables
# ("| id | name |") pass. Backticks are matched in URIs only, because markdown uses them for code.
# Reverse-shell and shell-invocation strings are distinctive and score 5 on their own.
# ==================================================================================================

